## 🎨 UI/UX DESIGN

### Card Design (Matches Homepage):
- **Layout**: Horizontal grid (3-5 cards)
- **Active State**: Blue border, blue background tint, checkmark indicator
- **Hover**: Scale up, shadow increase
- **Icons**: Large icon with gradient background (when active)
- **Metrics Preview**: Key metric displayed on card

### Dossier Design (Matches Homepage):
- **Header**: Full-width gradient background (matches capability color)
- **Content**: White background, rounded corners
- **Animation**: Slide in from bottom, fade in
- **Responsive**: Mobile-first, collapsible on small screens

